  instrument        poolbeta   trial seed 00000000013594b3   1214 trials
                    another probe is another trial sequence: its numbers
                    are not comparable with these (~0.05 at 300 trials)
  question          the larynx compresses -- dF1 ~ aligned^0.61 -- and that
                    curve both limits delivery AND kills the drift through
                    its derivative. Does sharpening the pooling widen it?
  the measure       EXCESS of taught over its own matched-marginal control,
                    per beta. A beta that lifts both has bought scatter.
  the real risk     teachability, not delivery. centroid-is-steerability
                    measured 5 dictionary readouts NOT teachable where 2
                    centroid ones were, so a hard argmax should fail here.


